# First run on an empty shelf (run with --bare): the bundled tutorial seeds
# itself, and the walkthrough plays it from the gatehouse to the ending.
wait-for Interactive fiction
wait-for First Light
clean
shot parser-firstrun-library
tap First Light
wait-for Gatehouse
clean
shot parser-firstrun-opening
tap Keyboard
type examine note
tap Run
wait-for stair head
type north
tap Run
wait-for Storeroom
type take lamp
tap Run
wait-for Taken.
type take matchbox
tap Run
type inventory
tap Run
wait-for matchbox
clean
shot parser-firstrun-inventory
type light lamp
tap Run
wait-for steady flame
type north
tap Run
wait-for learned the moves
wait-for story has ended
clean
shot parser-firstrun-ending
